{"t":"期房持有总成本计算器","d":"估算在海外购买并持有房产的真实成本:购置税费、物业费、贷款和租金,附可核查的各国默认值。","s":{"Kolaboro":"Kolaboro","Tools / Total cost":"工具 / 总成本","What will this property really cost you?":"这套房产实际要花您多少钱?","The price is only the start. Add purchase taxes, fees, service charges, financing and rent to see the cost of owning it for the years you plan to hold it.":"价格只是开始。加上购置税费、物业费、贷款和租金,看看在您计划持有的年份里拥有它要花多少钱。","Purchase details":"购买信息","The purchase":"购买","Country":"国家","Years you plan to hold it":"计划持有年数","Counted from signing.":"从签约起计算。","Purchase taxes and fees":"购置税费","typical, check locally":"常见值,请在当地核实","Lawyer or notary fees":"律师或公证费","Your quote":"您的报价","Amount. Ask for a written quote.":"金额。请索取书面报价。","Other one-off costs":"其他一次性费用","e.g. furniture pack":"例如家具套餐","Amount.":"金额。","Payment plan":"付款计划","Paid before handover (%)":"交房前已付(%)","Months until handover":"距交房月数","0 if it is ready. Running costs and rent start at handover.":"如已建成填 0。运营费用和租金从交房起计。","Running costs per year":"每年运营费用","Service charge per m² per year":"每平方米每年物业费","From the developer":"来自开发商","Size (m²)":"面积(m²)","Property or land tax per year":"每年房产税或土地税","Amount":"金额","Insurance and other per year":"每年保险及其他","Maintenance (% of price per year)":"维护(每年占价格的 %)","Your estimate":"您的估计","I plan to rent it out":"我打算出租","Gross rent per month":"每月毛租金","When rented":"出租时","Occupancy (%)":"入住率(%)","Management fee (% of rent)":"管理费(占租金的 %)","I will use a mortgage":"我会使用按揭贷款","Loan (% of price)":"贷款(占价格的 %)","Interest rate (% per year)":"利率(年 %)","Your offer":"您的报价","Term (years)":"期限(年)","We assume the loan starts at handover and is repaid monthly. Only interest counts as a cost; repaid capital stays yours.":"我们假设贷款从交房开始并按月偿还。只有利息计为成本,已还本金仍属于您。","Total cost of owning it, over":"持有总成本,期间","years":"年","Upfront cash you need":"您需要的首付资金","Yearly running cost":"年度运营费用","Net rent per year":"每年净租金","Interest over the period":"期间利息","Estimate only. Defaults are typical figures to verify with a local lawyer or the tax office, not e